\newlabel{fig:idea}{{1}{1}{\textbf {(a)} The same learned direction, trained on the same contrastive prompts, can form different concept classifiers, which reveals the existence of multiple coupled directions. \textbf {(b)} Determining the steering strength requires laborious continuous parameter tuning. \textbf {(c)} We propose utilizing adaptive retraining to refine the direction, and \textbf {(d)} leveraging the statistics of contrastive activations to determine the steering strength of each layer}{figure.1}{}}
\newlabel{fig:idea@cref}{{[figure][1][]1}{[1][1][]1}}
